259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Finally, we did find variation in public support for counter-drone operations based on who in the US authorized the operation. On average, Americans are more supportive of counter-drone operations in the US homeland when the US President \(53%\), Secretary of Defense \(53%\), or Commander of US Northern Command \(53%\) authorize these interdictions. Comparatively, public support for counter-drone operations authorized by installation leaders is not as strong, through it is still over 50%.)
/E (Finally, we did find variation in public support for counter-drone operations based on who in the US authorized the operation. On average, Americans are more supportive of counter-drone operations in the US homeland when the US President \(53%\), Secretary of Defense \(53%\), or Commander of US Northern Command \(53%\) authorize these interdictions. Comparatively, public support for counter-drone operations authorized by installation leaders is not as strong, through it is still over 50%.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
